{"page":154,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:31","surah":7,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰبَنِىٓ ءَادَمَ خُذُوا۟ زِينَتَكُمْ عِندَ كُلِّ مَسْجِدٍ وَكُلُوا۟ وَٱشْرَبُوا۟ وَلَا تُسْرِفُوٓا۟ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ لَا يُحِبُّ ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Adam, dress well whenever you are at worship, and eat and drink [as We have permitted] but do not be extravagant: God does not like extravagant people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَادَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Adam","transliteration":"ādama","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خُذُوا۟","en_gloss":"Take","transliteration":"khudhū","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"زِينَتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your adornment","transliteration":"zīnatakum","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"at","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَسْجِدٍۢ","en_gloss":"masjid","transliteration":"masjidin","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and eat","transliteration":"wakulū","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱشْرَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and drink","transliteration":"wa-ish'rabū","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"but (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُسْرِفُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"be extravagant","transliteration":"tus'rifū","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"love","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","en_gloss":"the extravagant ones","transliteration":"l-mus'rifīna","verse_key":"7:31"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:31"}]},{"verse_key":"7:32","surah":7,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ مَنْ حَرَّمَ زِينَةَ ٱللَّهِ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَخْرَجَ لِعِبَادِهِۦ وَٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ مِنَ ٱلرِّزْقِ ۚ قُلْ هِىَ لِلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ فِى ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنْيَا خَالِصَةً يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ نُفَصِّلُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘Who has forbidden the adornment and the nourishment God has provided for His servants?’ Say, ‘They are [allowed] for those who believe during the life of this world: they will be theirs alone on the Day of Resurrection.’ This is how We make Our revelation clear for those who understand.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَرَّمَ","en_gloss":"has forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarrama","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"زِينَةَ","en_gloss":"(the) adornment","transliteration":"zīnata","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(from) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّتِىٓ","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَخْرَجَ","en_gloss":"He has brought forth","transliteration":"akhraja","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِعِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"for His slaves","transliteration":"liʿibādihi","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلطَّيِّبَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"and the pure things","transliteration":"wal-ṭayibāti","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلرِّزْقِ ۚ","en_gloss":"sustenance","transliteration":"l-riz'qi","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هِىَ","en_gloss":"They","transliteration":"hiya","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) for those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"7:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","tra