","transliteration":"yastaqdimūna","verse_key":"7:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:34"}]},{"verse_key":"7:35","surah":7,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ ءَادَمَ إِمَّا يَأْتِيَنَّكُمْ رُسُلٌ مِّنكُمْ يَقُصُّونَ عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِى ۙ فَمَنِ ٱتَّقَىٰ وَأَصْلَحَ فَلَا خَوْفٌ عَلَيْهِمْ وَلَا هُمْ يَحْزَنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Children of Adam, when messengers come to you from among yourselves, reciting My revelations to you, for those who are conscious of God and live righteously, there will be no fear, nor will they grieve.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰبَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"O Children","transliteration":"yābanī","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَادَمَ","en_gloss":"(of) Adam","transliteration":"ādama","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِمَّا","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"immā","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَأْتِيَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"come to you","transliteration":"yatiyannakum","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُسُلٌۭ","en_gloss":"Messengers","transliteration":"rusulun","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"from you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَقُصُّونَ","en_gloss":"relating","transliteration":"yaquṣṣūna","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِى ۙ","en_gloss":"My Verses","transliteration":"āyātī","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَمَنِ","en_gloss":"then whoever","transliteration":"famani","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","en_gloss":"fears Allah","transliteration":"ittaqā","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَصْلَحَ","en_gloss":"and reforms","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَوْفٌ","en_gloss":"fear","transliteration":"khawfun","verse_key":"7:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"on them","trans